{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2022-05-12 09:10:00', 'title': 'BROADRIDGE DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.64 PER SHARE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC. (NYSE:BR)\xa0ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.64 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JULY 6, 2022 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 15, 2022.'}